# characterization baseline: 08-replay-is-idempotent
# Resetting a processed frame to 'new' re-acknowledges it without writing a second reading. This is what makes strand recovery safe.
# documents: docs/sequence-diagrams.md#replay-is-safe
#
# Masked values: <CLOCK> clock-derived datetime, <TOKEN> in-flight
# claim token, [PID] worker process id.

